  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1503.17 Cement Kiln Dust",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1503.17 Cement Kiln Dust. Cement kiln dust shall be deemed certified for distribution and use as an odor control agent for sludge and septage, as provided in Env-Wq 800 and Env-Wq 1600.\n\nSource. #7225, eff 3-31-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1500); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3203.17); ss by #10599, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
